  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the radii of inscribed and circumscribed circles for an $\\mathrm{n}$ sided regular polygon of side a, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{a}{4} \\cot \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2 n}\\right)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$a \\cot \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{n}\\right)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{a}{2} \\cot \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2 n}\\right)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\operatorname{acot}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2 n}\\right)$",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\tan \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{n}\\right)=\\frac{a}{2 r} ; \\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{n}\\right)=\\frac{a}{2 R}$\n\n$r+R=\\frac{a}{2}\\left[\\cot \\frac{\\pi}{n}+\\operatorname{cosec} \\frac{\\pi}{n}\\right] \\Rightarrow r+R=\\frac{a}{2} \\cdot \\cot \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2 n}\\right)$"
  }
